Error [E0120]: this loop can't take handles out of a field or index
  --> tests/ui/loop_task_list_field.jet:5:15
    |
  5 |     loop h, p.handles { total += h.join() ?? 0 }
    |               ^^^^^^^
 Why: each step hands you the handle itself, and a task handle cannot be copied — so the loop takes the whole list with the move-capability marker `^`
 Fix: bind the list into a local this scope owns first (`hs := …`), then write `loop h, hs { … }`
